format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NAGAMI, TETSUROU</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NAKANISHI, YASUYUKI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A disk device, comprising a rotatable bar-shaped loose-fitted means which is loosely fitted to the inner diameter of a disk (R) and a supporting means which forms a support part for supporting a part of the disk on the peripheral edge part of the loose-fitted means, wherein the supporting means is moved in the rotating axis direction of the loose-fitted means according to the rotation of the loose-fitted means.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un dispositif pour disque, comprenant un organe en forme de barre monté de façon lâche dans le diamètre intérieur d'un disque (R), et un organe de support formant une partie de support pour une partie du disque, sur la partie périphérique de l'organe monté lâche. L'organe de support se déplace dans le sens de l'axe de rotation de l'organe monté lâche en fonction de la rotation de cet organe.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>